+## Latest change set — `NameTBD_FlowList_v3_fix7.patch` (applies on top of `NameTBD_FlowList_v3_fix6.patch`; untested in editor)
+
+### Added
+- **Scrolling > Select While Scrolling** (default on, the old behavior). Off: dragging, flinging and wheeling only move the list - no select ticks, selection events, focus moves or Play On Selection animations for the items passed; the item at the focus is selected once the list comes to rest (`SFlowList::UpdateNearest` sets `bSelectionDueAtRest`, resolved where `OnSettled` fires). Navigation, clicks and Scroll To Index still select at once. Kept by Style Presets.
+
+### Files
+- Changed: `FlowListTypes.h/.cpp`, `SFlowList.h/.cpp`, `NameTBD_Handoff.md`.
+
+## Change set before — `NameTBD_FlowList_v3_fix6.patch` (applies on top of `NameTBD_FlowList_v3_fix5.patch`; untested in editor)
 
 ### Changed (user's rule: Anim Enter Item = selected, Anim Exit Item = unselected)
 - **Play On Selection is on by default** and listed first: the selected item plays Anim Enter Item, the one losing the selection Anim Exit Item. Add/Remove, Play Intro and Play As Items Scroll In And Out still play them too.
